      "writtenOn": "2020-09-29T18:35:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "pca9675 has only one register for both set \u0026 get of the I/O levels.\nsome of the pins need to be modified together (ex: set 01 same time)\nhence we kept it independent of struct ioexpander_drv.\n\nIs it okay to submit a follow on CL to change the driver to fit ioexpander_drv ?\nwe will add comments in driver and mention pca9675_update_pins() does both set \u0026 get.",
      "parentUuid": "2773e804_72db3151",
      "revId": "425b4e9775769de3361544e75bc7fe7ec0c2b22e",
